      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: prospective_without_white_; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a group of Black men in traditional African warrior attire, performing a cultural dance or ceremony. The overlaid text 'prospective without white \"\"' is ambiguous and appears to be a corrupted or incomplete phrase. The meme's intent is not clearly defined, but the juxtaposition of the text with the image of Black men in traditional dress could be interpreted as a racially charged or stereotypical commentary. The phrase 'without white' may imply a negative association with Blackness or suggest that Black people are somehow 'incomplete' or 'lacking' without white people, which aligns with harmful anti-Black stereotypes. The image itself does not contain overtly abusive or cyberbullying content, but the text combined with the visual could be perceived as hateful, especially if it implies that Black people are inferior or incomplete without white people. The meme may be attempting to provoke a reaction or spread a harmful message, but without more context, the exact intent is unclear. The overall intent is hateful due to the potential for the text to reinforce negative stereotypes about Black people.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_d640286f"
      },
